        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-16T03:38:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If so, I think that's an error.&nbsp; Kaargra doesn't have a \"Hero Character Card\" and she shouldn't count as a Player if you ask me.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Are you sure she didn't play Bloodswarn Judgement?&nbsp; It automatically puts the Title on top of the deck under the Villan target with the highest HP.&nbsp; That card sounds much more logical as the method by which a Villain target could get Chaos Lord.</p>",
