      {
        "id": 173053,
        "name": "Kratos13",
        "username": "Kratos13",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-16T10:54:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you are sure it's not Bloodsworn Judgement or her Advanced rule, please send us screenshots and logs if possible to <a href=\"mailto:feedback@handelabra.com\">feedback@handelabra.com</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm sorry I didn't save a screenshot. &nbsp;Will try and replicate. I'm very certain Bloodsworn Judgement was not played. &nbsp;I'll admit, a lot of things happened that villain turn so it wasn't easy to keep track of everything but things I know for sure:</p>\n<p>Most definitely not Advanced (I won the game!)</p>\n<p>Occurred during the Villain turn</p>\n<p>Chaos Lord was in play the round before the Villain turn (because I was hoping I could earn it with Tachyon or Chrono Ranger but didn't).</p>\n<p>Kaargra was not a target before or after the Villain turn.</p>\n<p>The Environment was the Block.</p>\n<p>Heroes were Team Leader Tachyon, Chrono Ranger, Skyscraper and Expatriette (no one incapped before or after Villain turn)</p>\n<p>I did not destroy any Ongoings or Equipment (I remember doing so early in the game for Bloodsworn Judgement).</p>\n<p>A target was destroyed and a Title played during the Villain turn (sorry lost track by whom on what at this point).</p>\n<p>If I can replicate, will note better details and send to feedback e-mail.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:56:06.852Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
