        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nIf you are sure it&#39;s not Bloodsworn Judgement or her Advanced rule, please send us screenshots and logs if possible to <a href=\"mailto:feedback@handelabra.com\">feedback@handelabra.com</a>.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;m sorry I didn&#39;t save a screenshot. &nbsp;Will try and replicate. I&#39;m very certain Bloodsworn Judgement was not played. &nbsp;I&#39;ll admit, a lot of things happened that villain turn so it wasn&#39;t easy to keep track of everything but things I know for sure:\n\nMost definitely not Advanced (I won the game!)\n\nOccurred during the Villain turn\n\nChaos Lord was in play the round before the Villain turn (because I was hoping I could earn it with Tachyon or Chrono Ranger but didn&#39;t).\n\nKaargra was not a target before or after the Villain turn.\n\nThe Environment was the Block.\n\nHeroes were Team Leader Tachyon, Chrono Ranger, Skyscraper and Expatriette (no one incapped before or after Villain turn)\n\nI did not destroy any Ongoings or Equipment (I remember doing so early in the game for Bloodsworn Judgement).\n\nA target was destroyed and a Title played during the Villain turn (sorry lost track by whom on what at this point).\n\nIf I can replicate, will note better details and send to feedback e-mail.\n\nThanks!\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n",
